206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 45 0 R
/T (Zoho Creator provides built-in mechanisms for managing users, roles, permissions and data visibility. In this experiment, the rene \(read\) and Write permission profiles were examined, the role hierarchy of CEO, Admission Manager and Admission Staff was viewed, and the Admission Manager role was set to report to the CEO with Share Data with Peers enabled for the Student Admission Enquiry Form application. Portal user permissions restrict external applicants to a Customer profile with add and view permission. The experiment therefore shows the access-control tools that Zoho Creator offers. Controlling who can access application data, and at what level, remains an essential part of building and managing business applications.)
/E (Zoho Creator provides built-in mechanisms for managing users, roles, permissions and data visibility. In this experiment, the rene \(read\) and Write permission profiles were examined, the role hierarchy of CEO, Admission Manager and Admission Staff was viewed, and the Admission Manager role was set to report to the CEO with Share Data with Peers enabled for the Student Admission Enquiry Form application. Portal user permissions restrict external applicants to a Customer profile with add and view permission. The experiment therefore shows the access-control tools that Zoho Creator offers. Controlling who can access application data, and at what level, remains an essential part of building and managing business applications.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
